sequenceDiagram
participant A0 as Scenario
participant A1 as SitePage
participant A2 as Navigator
participant A3 as Calendar
participant A4 as Wait
participant A5 as Browser
A0->>A1: open site / choose widget and iframe
A1->>A3: configure header, arrows and full-date locator
A0->>A2: Select(calendar, targetDate)
A2->>A3: read displayed month; enforce distance budget
A2->>A3: MoveMonth(sign) for each required step
A3->>A4: wait for arrow readiness; click once
A4->>A5: native click and header observations
A3-->>A2: expected adjacent month reached
A2->>A3: ClickDay(targetDate) in target month
A3->>A5: native click on fully qualified date cell
A0->>A1: assert committed value / range status
A1->>A4: wait for exact business result
